      "body": "## Highlights\n\n- Added FlavorDB2 natural-source, food-entity, and food–compound relationship integration.\n- Expanded PubChem PUG View with volatility and partition properties.\n- Added MassBank and GNPS open-spectrum search, licensed downloads, peak tables, mirror comparison, and PNG/SVG/CSV/JSON exports.\n- Added NIST WebBook presence links and ChEBI → Rhea → UniProt biochemical evidence.\n- Added evidence-bound NCBI Gene/Taxonomy, MetaboLights, BRENDA/HMDB links, bioactivity sources, and experimental/predicted protein structures.\n- Distributed the large GNPS index as a verified external Release asset instead of committing the 1 GB SQLite database to Git.\n- Added persistent Render deploy-hook automation with public API version and endpoint acceptance checks.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Python: 130/130\n- Frontend: 62/62\n- ESLint and production build passed\n- Desktop/mobile E2E and failure-isolation checks passed\n- GitHub Pages deployment passed\n- Render API deployment and public endpoint verification passed\n\nSee `CHANGELOG.md` and `PROJECT_HISTORY.md` for details."
    },
