      "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/XQplayer/FlavorInsightAI/tarball/v1.3.1",
      "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/XQplayer/FlavorInsightAI/zipball/v1.3.1",
      "body": "﻿## FlavorThresholdDB v1.3.1\n\n### Added\n- Rebuilt the Wine Flavor Chemistry book index with source-page traceability.\n- Merged same-CAS book hits into one card with per-source excerpts.\n- Added threshold media grouping and bilingual book-card identity display.\n- Added exact Chinese-name and English-name matching backed by canonical CAS filtering.\n\n### Fixed\n- Prevented related ester compounds from appearing in exact book searches.\n- Added separate expandable source excerpts with safe overflow handling.\n- Preserved alcoholic-beverage applications as application context rather than threshold systems.\n- Unified book-card Chinese name, English name, and CAS typography.\n\nValidation: 23 book-search tests passed, ESLint passed, production build passed.\r\n"
    },
