      "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/XQplayer/FlavorInsightAI/tarball/v1.3.0",
      "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/XQplayer/FlavorInsightAI/zipball/v1.3.0",
      "body": "## FlavorThresholdDB v1.3.0\n\nThis release upgrades the project from a threshold lookup page to a multi-source compound research workspace.\n\n### Added\n- PubChem identity, physicochemical properties, 2D/3D structures, crystal records, images, and coordinate downloads\n- FlavorDB flavor, odor, taste, and functional-group records\n- RDKit SMARTS-based primary compound classification\n- Supabase-backed live activity and popular-compound visualization\n\n### Improved\n- Unified compound profile header and larger medium badges\n- Source-specific FEMA, PubChem, FlavorDB, water, air, and other-medium colors\n- Threshold ordering by newest publication year and smallest threshold value\n- Filter-aware CSV export with Excel-safe CAS values\n- Responsive desktop/mobile layouts with no horizontal overflow\n- Public deployment documentation and Node 24-compatible GitHub Pages workflow\n\n### Deployment\n- GitHub Pages frontend: published successfully\n- Render Blueprint contains the updated public data proxy; existing manually managed Render services must run **Manual Deploy > Deploy latest commit** once to activate the new `/compound`, `/pubchem`, and `/flavordb` routes."
    },
