      "body": "## Live analytics\n\n- Added privacy-preserving cumulative visit, current online, cumulative search, and daily search counters.\n- Added a responsive top-30 compound treemap sized by verified search count.\n- Treemap labels use common English names; hover shows CAS, Chinese name, and count.\n- Selecting a tile opens the compound by CAS in exact search mode.\n- Added Supabase Presence and aggregate-only database migrations with public read policies and controlled RPC writes.\n- Migrated the Pages build to pnpm and configured Supabase deployment variables."
