      "body": "## UI optimization\n\n- Refined the homepage, navigation, search workbench, filters, result cards, and contact panel.\n- Added responsive layouts, accessible focus states, reduced-motion support, and consistent visual tokens.\n- Improved Chinese and English interface switching and active navigation states.\n- Added updated favicon assets and corrected page metadata.\n- Added GitHub Pages SPA fallback so the search page can be opened directly.\n- Preserved public FEMA Flavor Library querying and source traceability."
